  m_Name: Story_mateo
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NpcStoryArc
  npcId: mateo
  title: Eleven Kinds of Grass
  summary: 'Mateo looks after the park and worries about every blade of grass. City hall plans to sell half of it to Sterling for a car park, and his sister is the one with the forms on her desk. Fork: a ''Save the Park'' planting day, or a deal where Sterling keeps half and pays to clean the river.'
  pathAName: Save the park
  pathBName: Take the deal
  parts:
  - title: You can't hurry a plant
    number: 1
    heartsNeeded: 1
    path: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - Good to see you. Mind the edge of the pitch there, I re-seeded it on Tuesday.
    - A farmer understands. People think a park just happens. It doesn't. It's a thousand small worries, every day, and if you do it right, nobody notices any of them.
    happy: 0
    ask:
      item: {fileID: 0}
      amount: 0
      minQuality: 0
