  - title: Checking each other's work
    number: 2
    heartsNeeded: 2
    path: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - Ada watered the plaza planters at eight. I checked them at ten. She checked my hedges at eleven.
    - Neither of us has said a word about it for six years. It's the best working relationship I've ever had.
    happy: 0
    ask:
      item: {fileID: 0}
      amount: 0
      minQuality: 0
      questTitle: 
