  - title: Half a park
    number: 8
    heartsNeeded: 8
    path: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - A man from the tower came to see me. Not Lucia. Me. He had a deal.
    - Sterling keeps half the park for parking. In return they pay to clean the river. A new filter at the plant, new trees on the river path, everything.
    - Or we fight. Everybody on the street plants a tree in the park on the same day, and we make it impossible to build on. Lucia says city hall can't sell a park full of new trees.
    - Half a park and a clean river. Or the whole park and a river nobody's fixing yet. I can't choose. Will you?
    happy: 0
    ask:
      item: {fileID: 0}
      amount: 0
      minQuality: 0
      questTitle: 
      questText: 
      reminder: []
      thanks: []
    choice:
      enabled: 1
      optionA: Save the park
      replyA:
      - The whole park. We plant. Every house, one tree. I'll find the saplings, you bring the strong arms.
      - And then we find another way to fix the river. There's always another way. It's just slower.
      flagsA:
      - save_the_park
      optionB: Take the deal
      replyB:
      - The deal. Half the park. A clean river.
      - I'll sign it. I'll mark the new car park lines myself, so at least they're straight.
      flagsB:
      - park_deal
    setFlags: []
    reward:
      gold: 0
      item: {fileID: 0}
      amount: 0
      friendship: 0
  - title: Planting day
    number: 9
    heartsNeeded: 9
    path: 1
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - Did you see? Did you SEE? Two hundred trees in one morning. Nia planted four and named them all.
    - The surveyors came back on Monday and couldn't find a single spot for a stake. They stood there for an hour and then went away.
    - 'Lucia stamped the sale papers ''REJECTED: SITE UNSUITABLE''. In red. She says she''s wanted to use the red stamp for years.'
    happy: 1
    ask:
      item: {fileID: 0}
      amount: 0
      minQuality: 0
      questTitle: 
